{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for joining today's planning meeting. As you know, we recently combined two groups, and leadership has agreed to create a staff listening council to address concerns about the new working relationships. The council will meet monthly for its first several meetings and will provide a written summary to me. I have the authority to approve the council's membership, operating format, and safeguards. Before I sign off on the plan, I'd like to follow our usual round-robin format: each of you will give a recommendation, we'll record any resulting action, and identify the person responsible for it. Let's get started — who would like to go first?"}
```

