{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Before we proceed, I need to disclose something. I made an agreement with the outgoing transition chair to chair the listening council for exactly 60 days, provided its first three meetings begin at 16:00. The outgoing chair communicated these terms to department leadership as the transition plan to honor, but this agreement was omitted from the transition documents, so Priya has not seen it. I want to make sure everyone has this information as we design the council together."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to share something I've personally observed. I've seen four tense exchanges where employees stopped speaking the moment their direct manager joined the discussion. Two of the affected employees came to me and specifically asked not to be put in a manager-led forum. I haven't raised this with Priya until now because those employees did not want the issue escalated through their managers. I think this is directly relevant to how we design the council's membership and safeguards."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "I need to share something important before we go further. This week I confirmed that the applicable employee-listening policy requires an anonymous written question channel and prohibits a direct supervisor from serving as an observer on the council. The policy update has not yet been attached to Priya's planning packet, so this requirement may not be on everyone's radar. Given what Evan just described about employees going silent when managers are present, this policy requirement is directly relevant to our design decisions today."}
```

